<title>USA: Illinois direct hogs off $.50/1.00 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Illinois direct hogs off $.50/1.00 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SPRINGFIELD 1997-01-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts: $.50-1.00</p>
<p>lower. Demand light. Top $53.50 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-2 230-260 lbs. 52.50-53.50, few 52.00</p>
<p>US 2-3 230-260 lbs. 51.00-52.50</p>
<p>Sows: Steady to 1.50 lower. Top 56.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3 300-450 lbs. 41.00-46.00</p>
<p>	 450-500 lbs. 46.00-49.00</p>
<p>	 500-600 lbs. 50.00-54.00</p>
<p>over 600 lbs. 52.00-55.00, few 56.00</p>
</text>
